@eventId = 1
@mediaId = 1

### 1. Create a Single Media Record
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "eventId": 1,
  "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1540575467063-178a50c2df87?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80",
  "type": "image",
  "altText": "Event Main Conference Banner",
  "isPrimary": true
}

### 2. Bulk Create Media Items
POST {{baseUrl}}/bulk
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "items": [
    {
      "eventId": 1,
      "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1511578314322-379afb476865?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80",
      "type": "image",
      "altText": "Attendees networking at the gallery session",
      "isPrimary": false
    },
    {
      "eventId": 1,
      "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1492684223066-81342ee5ff30?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80",
      "type": "image",
      "altText": "Official event concert poster",
      "isPrimary": false
    }
  ]
}

### 3. Clone Event Media
POST {{baseUrl}}/clone
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "sourceEventId": 1,
  "targetEventId": 5
}

### 4. Batch Update Alt Text
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/alt-text/batch
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "updates": [
    {
      "mediaId": 8,
      "altText": "Updated Event Main Conference Banner"
    }
  ]
}

### 5. Set Media as Primary
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/11/primary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Update Media Metadata
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/{{mediaId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "altText": "Modified alt text description with Unsplash asset",
  "isPrimary": false
}

### 7. Delete Single Media Record
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/{{mediaId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Bulk Delete Media Items
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/bulk/delete
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "mediaIds": [1, 2]
}

### 9. Get All Media Paginated (Admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/all?limit=20&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. Get Recent Media
GET {{baseUrl}}/recent?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 11. Search Media by Alt Text
GET {{baseUrl}}/search?q=Conference
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 12. Get All Media for an Event
GET {{baseUrl}}/event/{{eventId}}

### 13. Get Primary Media for an Event
GET {{baseUrl}}/event/{{eventId}}/primary

### 14. Get Media Filtered by Type ('image' | 'video' .)
GET {{baseUrl}}/event/{{eventId}}/type?type=image

### 15. Count Total Media for an Event
GET {{baseUrl}}/event/{{eventId}}/count

### 16. Get Event Media Stats (Grouped by Type)
GET {{baseUrl}}/event/{{eventId}}/stats

### 17. Delete All Media Attached to an Event
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/event/{{eventId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 18. Verify if Media Belongs to an Event
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{mediaId}}/verify/{{eventId}}

### 19. Get Single Media Record by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{mediaId}}